# One CI gate, one file (issue #991).
ci_gate check_planner_twins
  stage web
  description "R1188-U16: the functions that modules under js/agentic/ export with no Rust twin in rust/src/ (by snake_case name or by a Mirrors citation) stay at or below the ceiling in data/meta/planner-twin-ratchet.lino, and the ceiling only falls."
  run "node scripts/check-planner-twins.mjs"
  justification "PR #1188 (R1188-U16) makes the agentic planner JavaScript first with a Rust twin for every behaviour; without a count, a planner function could land in JavaScript alone and nothing would fail."
